              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with an improvised weapon. May have a buckler (+1 pt). Spirit of the Shaman (causes fear; roll a D6 for the unit he is with at the start of the game). Subject to the Psychology of the group they join. Shamanic Challenge. 0-1. (The Art of War p.16)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="f9d4-dbed-a794-5d56" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
