              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Tribes of the North only. Warrior armed with a hand weapon riding in a two-horse light chariot with driver. May have shield (+4 pts), axe (+2 pts) and light armour (+3 pts) each. Light Chariots. One chariot squadron of three Light Chariot models per 1,000 points (not enforced), and chariots for characters. (The Art of War p.17)</characteristic>
