  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="d2df-e628-85fc-5cc6" name="Early Eastern Tribes (Art of War) - List Notes" publicationId="b792-78e1-7b03-d4d6" hidden="false">
      <description>EARLY EASTERN TRIBES (The Art of War, pp.15-17). Special rules: Army General - Hidden Ambush Force, Totems, Spirit of the Shaman (D6 table: 1 Snake - the unit does not move in the first turn and cannot move until it passes a Leadership test; 2 Bear - may not march but may re-roll missed To Wound rolls; 3 Deer - formed unit may make a free 4" move at the start of the game; 4 Wolf - Frenzy; 5 Eagle - may Fall Back in Good Order even if outnumbered; 6 Buffalo - Stubborn), Shamanic Challenge. Percentage limits are by points. "May only have one selected option per 1,000 points" for Special Units is documented only.

ARMY COMPOSITIONS (pick one in the Army composition list):
[Early Eastern Tribes - Basic Tribe]
  Characters: up to 33%
  Tribal Warriors: at least 33%
  Infantry: up to 50%
  BASIC TRIBE. Characters up to 33% (at least one character to lead). Tribal Warriors at least 33%. Infantry up to 50% (Skirmishers, Archers and Tribespeople). Tribal Warriors may take thrusting or throwing spears (+2) and javelins (+2).
[Early Eastern Tribes - Tribes of the East (Dong Yi)]
  Characters: up to 33%
  Tribal Warriors: at least 33%
  Infantry: up to 50%
  THE TRIBES OF THE EAST (Dong Yi). Favoured terrain: Temperate. Tribal Warriors are armed with thrusting spears and can be made Stubborn (+3). Their Totem is a stone dolman (+15 pts) instead of a Totem Bearer.
[Early Eastern Tribes - Tribes of the South (Man Yi)]
  Characters: up to 33%
  Tribal Warriors: at least 33%
  Infantry: up to 50%
  THE TRIBES OF THE SOUTH (Man Yi). Favoured terrain: Tropical. Tribal Warriors are skirmishers armed with throwing spears. Tribal Archers may have poisoned arrows (+1 pt). May not take light armour.
[Early Eastern Tribes - Tribes of the West (Rong Yi)]
  Characters: up to 33%
  Tribal Warriors: at least 33%
  Infantry: up to 50%
  THE TRIBES OF THE WEST (Rong Yi). Favoured terrain: Mountains. Tribal Warriors are armed with throwing spears and are treated like Light Infantry and are not subject to the Warband rules (documented). Their Totem is a spirit stone (+15 pts) instead of a Totem Bearer.
[Early Eastern Tribes - Tribes of the North (Di Yi)]
  Characters: up to 33%
  Tribal Warriors: at least 33%
  Infantry: up to 50%
  THE TRIBES OF THE NORTH (Di Yi). Favoured terrain: Steppes. Tribal Warriors are armed with thrusting spears; may take dagger axes (+1 pt). May take chariots for characters and one chariot squadron of three Light Chariot models per 1,000 points.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
